    "description": "The server side of BlazorHMR, as a .NET tool (blazor-hmr): watches a Blazor WebAssembly or Photino desktop app and the libraries it uses,\n\t\t\tcompiles every change in-memory (as an in-place update where possible), and pushes it to the client."
